{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13203290","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13203290","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:3:1320329001:1":{"text":"お客様、荘園内ではお静かにお願いいたします。","source_cn":"噢！尊贵的客人，请不要在永寂庄园内大呼小叫！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x49FC5FBCFBBE40A7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1320329002:1":{"text":"永寂の荘園の名の通り、ご主人様は騒々しいのがお嫌い――","source_cn":"正如它的名字那般，庄园需要保持安静。子爵先生不喜欢被——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8197AB2EE2D72D6B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1320329003:1":{"text":"キャンデラさん！今すぐリュボミルさんに会わせてください！","source_cn":"瓦茨拉夫，我们有急事要找柳博米尔！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x22DEC97CE051FEF5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1320329004:1":{"text":"ごほんっ。ご主人様は絵の修復でお忙しいのです。それが終わるまでお待ちくださいますよう……","source_cn":"咳，子爵先生正忙于修复画作，眼下没有比这更重要的事，还...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x867056555F4F5AF5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1320329005:1":{"text":"その絵の――いえ、その絵を描いた画家さんのことでお話があるんです！","source_cn":"我们要说的事就和那幅画——不对，和那幅画的画家有关！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5833359B8D41AEC0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:8:1320329005":{"text":"その絵の――いえ、その絵を描いた画家さんのことでお話があるんです！","source_cn":"我们要说的事就和那幅画——不对，和那幅画的画家有关！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5833359B8D41AEC0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1320329006:1":{"text":"なんと！？それは確かに一大事でありますね。","source_cn":"——哦不！这、这的确是件大事！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE51537F4BCBB6232","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1320329007:1":{"text":"ですが、ご主人様は修復作業に集中しておられます。それを邪魔するのは……","source_cn":"但子爵先生工作时需要集中精神，此时过去打扰实在是……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4045542BAA66A829","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1320329008:1":{"text":"お願いします、キャンデラさん！早くリュボミルさんに知らせないと！","source_cn":"拜托了，瓦茨拉夫！这件事必须尽早让柳博米尔知道！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x098509C535917BEA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1320329009:1":{"text":"……承知いたしました。ご主人様にお伝えいたします。ですが皆様に会われるかは分かりませんよ。","source_cn":"……好吧，好吧。我会将诸位的话告知子爵先生，但是否与你...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0D7EFDCF1E44193C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1320329010:1":{"text":"なるべく早く戻りますので。どうぞ、ご自由におくつろぎください。","source_cn":"诸位可以在庄园内随意打发时间，我会尽快回来的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB1DE6B3858C2AAC8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:8:0:1":{"text":"レフスキーがもうすぐ死ぬかもしれないんだ。","source_cn":"列夫斯基不久于人世了","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xE06B69F70E2F9304","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"レフスキーがもうすぐ死ぬかもしれないんだ。","female":"レフスキーがもうすぐ死ぬかもしれないの。","variant_male_record_index":"68478","variant_female_record_index":"68479","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:8:1:2":{"text":"レフスキーはもう限界なんだ。","source_cn":"列夫斯基可能坚持不下去了","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xEDBA4BE65C906261","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"レフスキーはもう限界なんだ。","female":"レフスキーはもう限界なの。","variant_male_record_index":"68480","variant_female_record_index":"68481","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:管家瓦茨拉夫":{"text":"執事のキャンデラ","source":"管家瓦茨拉夫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"メイメイ","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"ロンロン","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":14,"localized_text_count":13,"speaker_count":3}}